      "translationZh": "Amazon Bedrock 上的 Grok | SpaceXAI",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "d7e8198823ecbe72",
      "translationZh": "Amazon Bedrock 上的 Grok",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "61c622b0f21c1d1b",
      "translationZh": "Grok 模型现已可通过 Amazon Bedrock 使用。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9a206fe2ca91452b",
      "translationZh": "今天，我们很高兴地宣布，Grok 4.3 现已在 Amazon Bedrock 上正式开放使用。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4db0660f39e35b54",
      "translationZh": "Grok 4.3 在前沿模型中实现了最低的幻觉率，提供 100 万 token 的上下文窗口，并支持可配置的推理强度（无、低、中、高）。现在，Amazon Bedrock 用户可以通过 Bedrock 安全可靠的推理引擎使用该模型。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "9de045d187f686e3",
      "translationZh": "企业应用中的领先性能",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "78f879e78c3413f9",
      "translationZh": "在构建可用于企业环境的 AI 智能体方面，Grok 4.3 是当今可用的最强模型之一：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "e0bef34ba38b7089",
      "translationZh": "在 Artificial Analysis Omniscience 基准测试*中排名第 1，在前沿模型中实现了最低的幻觉率。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "387e7f133087ac5e",
      "translationZh": "在 Artificial Analysis Tau2 Telecom 基准测试*中排名第1，该测试评估客户支持智能体场景中的实际工具调用表现。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "b1f378352ee43b4c",
      "translationZh": "在 Vals AI Case Law 和 Corporate Finance 基准测试中排名第1，这些测试衡量 Grok 在复杂文档理解任务中的能力。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "44ffe48ed3c4970e",
      "translationZh": "与主要前沿实验室相比",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "4be61b9f65580f3c",
      "translationZh": "能力与定价",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "367a61830b1a0428",
      "translationZh": "Grok 4.3 位于智能水平与成本之间的帕累托前沿，每美元所获得的智能水平是其他前沿模型的2-10倍。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "e64ae74e10982216",
      "translationZh": "输入：每1百万 tokens 为1.25",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "d4b731ec4d7f02b1",
      "translationZh": "输出：每1百万 tokens 为2.50",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "878c1de0cac38b16",
      "translationZh": "它具备1百万的上下文窗口，可轻松处理极长的文档和代码库。开发者还可以配置推理：对于简单请求，使用 none 以获得最快速度；或使用 low / medium / high，根据问题的难度调整推理投入。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0017",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "60e2ed4cdc3288de",
      "translationZh": "在 Amazon Bedrock 上使用 Grok 4.3 构建应用",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0018",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e1c77404e476cb34",
      "translationZh": "Grok 4.3 现已向受支持的 AWS Regions 中的所有开发者开放。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0019",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "39b3a9190a45c7ea",
      "translationZh": "如需开始使用，请参阅 Grok on Amazon Bedrock 文档。我们期待看到你构建的成果！",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    }
  ],
